- `@` matches the @ symbol.
- `[\w\.-]+` matches one or more word characters (letters, numbers, underscores), periods, or hyphens.
- `+` quantifier means one or more of the preceding element.
- `\.` matches the period symbol.
- `+` quantifier means one or more of the preceding element.
- `.` matches the dot character, indicating any character (including newline) at the end.

