### STEP 1: IDENTIFYING ERRORS IN THE GIVEN CODE

SUPPOSE WE HAVE THE FOLLOWING JAVASCRIPT CODE THAT IMPLEMENTS A BASIC SORTING ALGORITHM (ASSUMING IT IS A BUBBLE SORT):

```javascript
function sortArray(arr) {
  for (var i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    for (var j = 0; j < arr.length; j++) {
      if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
